  "text": "No!"
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "start": 43.26,
  "end": 44.88,
  "text": "It'll still be there in the morning I promise."
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "start": 46.58,
  "end": 48.82,
  "text": "I can look at the shit where they're coming in from over there. Have a look."
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "start": 49.32,
  "end": 50.4,
  "text": "Just give me one more try."
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "start": 51.08,
  "end": 52.7,
  "text": "We can both hit the top and make time."
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "start": 52.82,
  "end": 54.58,
  "text": "We're all within an hour. I know we can do that."
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "start": 54.6,
  "end": 55.5,
  "text": "I want to summit today."
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "start": 55.8,
  "end": 56.68,
  "text": "You know, Daddy's exactly what you're..."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "start": 56.68,
  "end": 58.18,
  "text": "No, I want to summit today, Tommy."
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "start": 58.3,
  "end": 60.22,
  "text": "And that's exactly why you have a climbing partner."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "start": 60.64,
  "end": 61.92,
  "text": "So that someone can make the call"
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "start": 61.92,
  "end": 63.14,
  "text": "when one of you loses the plot."
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "start": 64.24,
  "end": 65.28,
  "text": "So I'm making a call."
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "start": 66.28,
  "end": 66.52,
  "text": "Okay?"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "start": 67.96,
  "end": 69.46,
  "text": "Sash, it's all good."
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "start": 70.06,
  "end": 73.82,
  "text": "It was beautiful climbing up until when it wasn't."
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "start": 81.98,
  "end": 83.76,
  "text": "Just wondering whether we should take a rain check"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "start": 83.76,
  "end": 84.5,
  "text": "tomorrow, that's all."
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "start": 84.5,
  "end": 86.78,
  "text": "Are you kidding me? It's just a little weather."
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "start": 87.6,
  "end": 88.6,
  "text": "What's going on?"
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "start": 89.88,
  "end": 91.48,
  "text": "You know, I just..."
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "start": 92.42,
  "end": 95.0,
  "text": "I just feel like sometimes you rush it a little bit, that's all."
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "start": 106.5,
  "end": 107.3,
  "text": "Anything else?"
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "start": 110.5,
  "end": 113.16,
  "text": "I don't know how many more of these trips I've got left in me."
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "start": 113.88,
  "end": 116.56,
  "text": "Look, don't get me wrong, I love this."
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "start": 117.44,
  "end": 119.0,
  "text": "I love us. I love you."
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "start": 119.34,
  "end": 125.14,
  "text": "Stop it. You do this every time. You know, the climb gets tough, and then all of a sudden you start talking like this."
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "start": 125.2,
  "end": 129.58,
  "text": "I'm just talking about slowing it down a little bit, not doing so many extreme things."
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "start": 129.94,
  "end": 130.7,
  "text": "Oh my god."
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "start": 135.58,
  "end": 140.7,
  "text": "It's an old saying, luck is like anything else you take up the mountain, eventually it's gonna run out."
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "start": 141.3,
  "end": 141.82,
  "text": "You serious?"
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "start": 143.76,
  "end": 147.7,
  "text": "You're gonna tell me your luck has run out. Half way up a mountain."
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "start": 147.96,
  "end": 149.72,
  "text": "Give my lucky compass a say, I shouldn't."
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "start": 149.84,
  "end": 151.8,
  "text": "Oh my god, just stop touching fucking compass."
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "start": 157.38,
  "end": 158.46,
  "text": "I'm sorry, Sash."
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "start": 160.46,
  "end": 161.8,
  "text": "I'm just playing a bit of a suck."
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "start": 163.76,
  "end": 164.36,
  "text": "Come here."
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "start": 169.16,
  "end": 170.44,
  "text": "Where does it hurt?"
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "start": 171.84,
  "end": 172.94,
  "text": "Yeah, right there."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "start": 173.2,
  "end": 174.06,
  "text": "Here, here, here."
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "start": 174.82,
  "end": 175.34,
  "text": "Oh!"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "start": 176.5,
  "end": 177.02,
  "text": "Jesus."
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "start": 179.46,
  "end": 182.0,
  "text": "Promise me we'll be back after the storm's passed."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "start": 182.48,
  "end": 183.76,
  "text": "We'll get down first thing, okay?"
 }
